WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.251 --> 00:00:02.704
-Hey, guys, I'm hanging out with
Gaten Matarazzo.

00:00:02.704 --> 00:00:05.604
And we decided to play
"Among Us" with a few friends.

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:07.574
It's an online game where you're
either a crew mate

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:10.076
trying to finish tasks
or an imposter

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.111
trying to secretly eliminate
the crew.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.347
We're doing this to raise
money for the charity

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.249
Feeding America.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.284
Please donate if you can.
You ready to do this?

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:19.819
-Yes.

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.655
♪♪

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:25.158
-Hey, guys, we're gonna play a
few rounds of "Among Us."

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.660
Playing with me today, please
welcome from "Stranger Things"

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.597
Gaten Matarazzo
and Noah Schnapp.

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:34.667
From "The Roots" we have
Tariq Trotter, Questlove,

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.236
and Kirk Douglas.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:39.939
From the "Among Us" team,
Victoria Tran.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:44.277
And we have streaming icons,
Sykkuno, Valkyrae,

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:47.580
and of course Corpse Husband.
-Hello.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.516
-Guys, here we go.

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:53.152
Where am I? Oh, I'm the blue.
Alright, I went naked.

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:54.921
I'm Smurf-ing it out.
-Ya naked.

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:59.024
-Smurf.

00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:00.293
-Alright, I'm nervous.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.996
-Don't worry, Jimmy.
-Don't worry, Jimmy, we got you.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:04.864
-These guys bothering you,
Jimmy?

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.032
-Yeah.
-Why'd you stand on a vent?

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:08.467
-Hey, back up.
-Why'd you stand on a vent?

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.736
-I didn't stand on a vent.
Stop following me, man.

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:11.871
-You walked right on top of it.
-Get away from me.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.773
Everybody get away from me.
What's going on?

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:17.009
Let me be. Oh, my gosh! No!
-Okay.

00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:21.047
-No! Oh, no!
-I think he's the imposter.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.948
-Please!
-I'm thinking he's the imposter.

00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:24.684
-Jimmy's definitely the
imposter.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:26.185
-What color's your name?
What color's your name?

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:28.387
-Stop following me.
Everyone, stop it.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.589
-You're all making Jimmy super
nervous. [ Laughs ]

00:01:30.589 --> 00:01:32.392
-I actually almost started
crying right there.

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:34.494
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:38.731
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.266
-Oh, no!
-Ooh!

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.400
-Who's dead?
-[ Gasps ]

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.501
-Not me.
-Who killed 'Rae?

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:45.404
-Oh, my God, not 'Rae!
-'Rae!

00:01:45.404 --> 00:01:48.441
-Alright, I'm gonna say it's
Tariq.

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:49.876
-It definitely wasn't me.
-Wait, why?

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:51.311
-Well, why'd you vote first
though?

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:53.880
-Just because I saw Gaten, like,
hanging out being real random.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.581
-You voted for me?!
-Like he was trying to

00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:57.383
prank somebody.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.218
-You guys, vote Tariq, or he's
gonna kill you all.

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:02.321
-Oh, God.
-Wow.

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:05.424
Wow!
-No!

00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:08.394
-He was innocent.
-Y'all did me dirty.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.196
-Kirk, what are you doing on
that vent?!

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:15.535
Oh, Kirk, no! Oh, no!
-I get the feeling

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:16.969
that it might be Kirk.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:19.739
-Guys, emergency meeting.
-Telling you, man, it's Kirk.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.907
-Kirk all the way, dude.
-Why?

00:02:21.907 --> 00:02:24.343
-Flipped down the wall.
-Oh, he vented?

00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:26.011
-It sounds like it might be
Jimmy.

00:02:26.011 --> 00:02:28.014
-No, man, I never saw anyone go
down the vent.

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:30.216
-You're projecting, Jimmy.
-I voted for Kirk.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:31.417
-I'm thinking it might be Jimmy.

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:32.652
-Look at this, look at this,
watch this.

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:34.887
What a different game we played.

00:02:34.887 --> 00:02:37.290
Kirk wa--
[ Cheering ]

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.524
-He was one!

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:40.326
-Alright, this mean Jimmy's
innocent, right?

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.928
-I never doubted him.
-Guys, everyone stick together.

00:02:42.928 --> 00:02:45.164
-I'm confused.
-Hi, Noah.

00:02:45.164 --> 00:02:46.532
-Hi, Gabe.
-What's up buddy?

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:49.101
-Oh, God, the door!
Who closed the door?

00:02:49.101 --> 00:02:51.537
-Why is it locked?
-The doors are locked.

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:55.808
-You have to wait f-- [Gasps]
-Am I dead or am I in the vents

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.676
playing around waiting for you
guys?

00:02:57.676 --> 00:02:59.244
-Oh, my God.
-Wait, what.

00:02:59.244 --> 00:03:02.014
-Oh, my God. Jimmy just vented.
-Jimmy just vented?

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:03.582
-Jimmy just vented.
-Jimmy just vented?

00:03:03.582 --> 00:03:05.318
-Jimmy just vented.
-Jimmy just vented.

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:07.153
-Is Jimmy the other one?
-Wait what?

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:09.088
-Jimmy, you just gave yourself
away.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.023
-Look, look.
Now that we've all voted,

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:14.360
Jimmy didn't actually vent,
didn't actually vent.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.862
-[ Laughs ]
-Actually bad.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:20.566
-[ Gasps ] It wasn't Jimmy!
-Oh, my gosh!

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:22.968
-Huh.
-Noah did me?

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:26.205
-It was Noah!
-Noah, are you joining me?

00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:28.374
-Good job Noah.
-Noah, good job.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:31.644
That was the real deal.
-You should be an actor.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.713
-Alright, here we go.
This one is for real.

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:35.515
-The real one.
-Alright. No more practice.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:36.548
-No more practice.

00:03:36.548 --> 00:03:38.351
-I just want to
witness a murder.

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:40.586
-Someone's gonna die, someone's
gonna die here.

00:03:40.586 --> 00:03:44.423
♪♪

00:03:44.423 --> 00:03:49.261
-Oh. Ahh!
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:49.261 --> 00:03:52.364
-Yo, I saw my murderer.
-You did?

00:03:52.364 --> 00:03:55.334
-Someone decapitated me.

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:58.171
-You guys all hanging out?
Trust.

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:01.006
Trust in the bathroom, dude.
-What? [ Laughs ]

00:04:01.006 --> 00:04:04.343
-Just everyone stand on top of
each other. [ Laughs ]

00:04:04.343 --> 00:04:06.712
-Why are we all here?
-Because we all gotta

00:04:06.712 --> 00:04:09.849
trust each other and
understand that we're a team.

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:11.817
-This game is getting very
clique-ish.

00:04:11.817 --> 00:04:16.088
-[ Blows raspberry ]

00:04:16.088 --> 00:04:20.493
-Ohh!
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:24.163
-Kirk's dead. Kirk's dead.
-They killed me.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:26.732
-The Roots are dead.
-The murderer is wearing

00:04:26.732 --> 00:04:29.034
glasses right now.
-It's not me!

00:04:29.034 --> 00:04:31.304
-I think it's Sykkuno.
-What?!

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:33.739
-'Rae's the murderer.
-I think that it might be 'Rae.

00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:37.242
-'Rae. 'Rae. 'Rae. 'Rae. 'Rae.
-'Rae. 'Rae. 'Rae. 'Rae. 'Rae.

00:04:37.242 --> 00:04:41.981
-Oh, they're just chanting
"'Rae, 'Rae, 'Rae."

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:44.517
-My God, you guys voted for me.
-My God.

00:04:44.517 --> 00:04:47.853
-Are you kidding me?! It's not
Sykkuno. Are you joking?

00:04:47.853 --> 00:04:51.023
-You guys are crazy!
Oh, Jesus!

00:04:51.023 --> 00:04:52.758
-Oh, I'm [Indistinct]
-Alright.

00:04:52.758 --> 00:04:56.062
Two imposters remain.
-It's not 'Rae.

00:04:56.062 --> 00:04:58.831
You're trolling.
-'Rae, I can see it

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:01.767
in your glasses reflection.
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:04.737
-You did? [ Laughs ]
-Corpse, man,

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:06.772
he's on fire tonight.
-Big guess.

00:05:06.772 --> 00:05:10.576
-Noah, come here. Come to this
deep, dark corner.

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:13.445
[ Laughs ]
-[ Gasps ] 'Rae!

00:05:13.445 --> 00:05:16.649
-Oh, my God! It was 'Rae!
-'Rae took a knife

00:05:16.649 --> 00:05:19.352
and decapitated my head off
violently.

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:21.187
-And then laughed at it.
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:23.855
-'Rae brought me into a corner
and killed me.

00:05:23.855 --> 00:05:25.958
-I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.728
-Game over!
Thank you, guys, for playing.

00:05:28.728 --> 00:05:31.230
Thanks for raising a lot of
money for Feeding America.

